      "content": "the \"surviving\" thing is what's so draining. like, why am i even trying to survive this version of myself? the person who was happy, the person who had a purpose... they aren't coming back. it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life, waiting for something that’s never going to happen. it would be so much easier to just stop fighting the emptiness and let it take over.",
